# Default: every text file normalizes to LF on every platform.
# Byte-pinned artifacts below opt out with -text.
* text=auto eol=lf

# sha-bearing artifacts: bytes are load-bearing (manifest_sha256 in receipts,
# shard sha256 chains). git must NEVER rewrite line endings at checkout.
corpus-manifests/** -text
receipts/** -text
tokenizer/** -text
# docs/research/ holds raw-byte-pinned premises (fp26_prereg pins the decision
# artifact's sha256 over exact on-disk bytes); CRLF normalization on Windows
# checkouts drifts those bytes and fails the prereg premise. Pin -text (eng-47).
# Re-anchored 2026-07-06 (#230): the pattern was "research/**", anchored to a
# bare top-level research/ directory that has never existed in this repo — the
# real, and only, directory is docs/research/. The gap left the decision
# artifact unprotected and is the concrete mechanism identified for its drift.
docs/research/** -text
docs/domains/governance/research/** -text
# ledger views + probe sets are sha-bound by audit receipts (sp-3/fp-28 bind
# byte-true sha256); CRLF conversion on fresh checkouts drifts the bytes vs
# the recorded sha. Pin -text (same class as the eng-47 research/** pin).
receipts/ledger/** -text
probes/** -text
# nck-protected paths: sha256 hashes in nck-invariants.json are load-bearing;
# git must not rewrite line endings at checkout (same class as eng-47 research/**).
docs/domains/governance/authority/GOAL.md -text
docs/domains/governance/archive/pre-restart/formalization-v0.md -text
# Updated 2026-07-06 (#230): #219 renamed config/ -> configs/ but missed these
# three exact-path pins, silently exposing domains/model/configs/v0-pretrain-config.json (the
# NC-K governor-headroom-config manifest entry) to LF normalization.
domains/model/configs/v0-pretrain-config.json -text
domains/model/configs/nck-invariants.json -text
configs/nck-baseline/** -text
domains/model/configs/nck-baseline/** -text
# scripts and hooks: enforce LF (prevents CRLF creep on Windows checkouts)
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
# Baseline packet: force reproducible LF across Windows/Unix checkouts.
baseline/** text eol=lf
baseline/**/*.py text eol=lf
baseline/**/*.sh text eol=lf
baseline/**/*.md text eol=lf
baseline/**/*.json text eol=lf
baseline/**/*.jsonl text eol=lf
docs/authority/INVARIANT.md -text
tests/fixtures/ember-cli/issue-243/live-resize-v1/** -text -diff
tests/fixtures/domain-governance/ember-cli/issue-243/live-resize-v1/** -text -diff
